      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ok found the solution. Found out if I look at the steamVR bindings before loading up vrchat I can see my old bindings. Notices my screenshots here said \"use as trackpad\" and \"use as button\". I would not know how to fix this if that was not the case I could see my old bindings... these were bindings that were 3+ years old so prob why I didn't remember how to do it. Warn people before wiping their bindings next time so they can have time to screenshot/write down their bindings. Lucky you can still check them before loading vrchat!\n\nMark as fixed !",
      "viewerReactions": null,
